OL,6,G0300 Joanna Lumley's Danube
OL,7,     FThe last leg of Joanna's Danube
OL,8,     Fjourney takes her across Romania,
OL,9,     Fstarting at the vast Iron Gates
OL,10,     Fgorge. The actress travels into
OL,11,     Fwild Transylvania, where she
OL,12,     Ffollows the trails of brown bears
OL,13,     Fin the forest and discovers the
OL,14,     Fsecret history of Dracula's
OL,15,     Fcastle. After a night in a guest
OL,16,     Fhouse owned by King Charles and an
OL,17,     Fencounter with Europe's witches,
OL,18,     FJoanna heads towards the Danube
OL,19,     FDelta, the Black Sea, and the
OL,20,     Ffinale of her adventure
